  <datafield tag="505" ind1="0" ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Acknowledgments -- Introduction -- Allan Kaprow on happenings, activities and booklets -- Publications 1962-1992 -- Words, 1962 -- Assemblage, environments &amp; happenings, 1966 -- How to make a happening (LP), 1966 -- Some recent happenings, 1966 -- Untitled essays and other works, 1967 -- Moving : Photoalbum : A happening by Allan Kaprow, 1967 -- Record II : For Roger Shattuck, 1968 -- Click, 1969 -- Pose, 1970 -- Days off : a calendar of happenings, 1970 -- Time pieces, 1973 -- 2nd routine, 1974 -- On time, 1974 -- 2 measures, 1974 -- Rates of exchange, 1975 -- Routine, 1975 -- Match, 1975 -- Comfort zones, 1975 -- Air condition, 1975 -- Warm-ups, 1975 -- Likely stories, 1975 -- Useful fictions, 1975 -- Echo-logy, 1975 -- Maneuvers, 1976 -- 7 kinds of sympathy, 1976 -- Satisfaction, 1976 -- Testimonials, 1976 -- Sweet wall/testimonials, 1976 -- Standards, 1979 -- Blindsight, 1979 -- Collagen, environments, videos, --1986 -- 7 environments, 1992 -- Catalogs, monographs and anthologies -- Biographical note -- Index.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1="8" ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"... catalogues and illustrates, with a wide selection of images, Alan Kaprow's entire body of published work: from his first artist's book in 1962, to his last anthological projects in the 1990s. This lesser-known side of his oeuvre unfolds through 32 books, booklets, and pamphlets produced over a period of 40 years." --back cover.</subfield>
  </datafield>
